#: src/window.vala:113
msgid ""
"PackageSearch is an app for searching, browsing and installing packages from "
"the ALT Linux repositories (Sisyphus, p11, p10, p9, c10f2, c9f2).\n"
"\n"
"Search by source or binary package name, by file or path, by maintainer, and "
"by task ID. Inspect metadata, RPM packages, dependencies as a graph, "
"changelog, spec files, versions across branches, and known bugs.\n"
"\n"
"You can also install and update packages."
msgstr ""
"PackageSearch — приложение для поиска, просмотра и установки пакетов "
"репозиториев ALT Linux (Sisyphus, p11, p10, p9, c10f2, c9f2).\n"
"\n"
"Ищите по имени исходного или бинарного пакета, по файлу или пути, по "
